d`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"611e904fa1562f6240f58cc90512f8e3","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"14b46fb1069b8a9c7f3bc83b9ac67241","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"55d14f26f7e20eff0bab36ee20f96569","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2213dde2952f61c9ec1dc4c5436e734d","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"4e6b1b5e6795ed8f27437a141ab5ff84","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"21c3d2ac39642fd0b339c7fe8f29f720","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"e26a3420faf14f26e6fbe48edcf380ea","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"2d947117c9e5732351f709b3b5b385ea","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"fb287e025403ab1585cbd18d650ab4a4","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[True]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1795013688112,"stop":1795013688215,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":